  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "メガストーンを　もったまま　たたかう\nポケモンを　メガシンカさせる\nみちのパワーを　ひめた　いし。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "메가스톤을 지닌 채로 싸우는\n포켓몬을 메가진화시키는\n미지의 힘을 가진 돌.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "隱藏著未知力量的石頭。\n能讓攜帶著超級石戰鬥的\n寶可夢進行超級進化。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pierre aux pouvoirs mystérieux permettant à\nun Pokémon tenant la Méga-Gemme adéquate\nde méga-évoluer.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Stein mit unbekannten Kräften. Er kann im\nKampf bei Pokémon, die einen Mega-Stein tragen,\neine Mega-Entwicklung auslösen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Piedra de singulares poderes que permite\nmegaevolucionar en combate a un Pokémon que\nlleve consigo una Megapiedra.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pietra dotata di un misterioso potere.\nDurante la lotta, può innescare la megaevoluzione\ndei Pokémon che hanno una Megapietra.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A stone filled with an unexplained power. It makes\nPokémon that battle with a Mega Stone\nMega Evolve.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "メガストーンを　持ったまま　戦う\nポケモンを　メガシンカさせる\n未知のパワーを　秘めた　石。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "蕴藏着未知力量的石头。\n能让携带着超级石战斗的\n宝可梦进行超级进化。",
